{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unpack and Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open boxes to find a variety of items and furniture, each with its own place in your new home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017730/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1745060392\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Decorate Freely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrange everything from sofas to small cups, creating spaces that feel comfortable and lived-in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017730/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1745060392\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple Stories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about the character\u2019s past and dreams through the things they\u2019ve kept. Watch the home evolve as you move through different stages of the character\u2019s life, reflecting changes and milestones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017730/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1745060392\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relaxing Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take all the time you need to sort, organize, and decorate without the pressure of scores, timers or competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017730/extras/Gif_4.gif?t=1745060392\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sandbox Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this mode, you can experiment freely with the items and furniture you\u2019ve unpacked. Unleash your imagination and turn your virtual space into a personalized haven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017730/extras/Gif_5.gif?t=1745060392\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the calm and satisfaction of making a new place feel like home in Unbox the Room!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3017730?t=1745060392","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3017730?t=1745060392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017730/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745060392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017730/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745060392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unpack and Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open boxes to find a variety of items and furniture, each with its own place in your new home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017730/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1745060392\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Decorate Freely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrange everything from sofas to small cups, creating spaces that feel comfortable and lived-in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017730/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1745060392\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple Stories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about the character\u2019s past and dreams through the things they\u2019ve kept. Watch the home evolve as you move through different stages of the character\u2019s life, reflecting changes and milestones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017730/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1745060392\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relaxing Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take all th